<title>PERU: TABLE - Peru's D'Onofrio 6-mo net plummets.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Peru's D'Onofrio 6-mo net plummets.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 51,200 soles vs 3.7 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 84.0 million soles vs 84.3 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: D'Onofrio is Peru's largest ice cream and confectionery company. In April, Switzerland's Nestle SA bought 98.7 percent of the company.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
